::GEO_U04_L06_Q20::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U04_L06_Q20<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.TRI.4<br><br>Question:<br>A student writes sin A = <sup>adjacent</sup>&frasl;<sub>hypotenuse</sub>. What correction is needed? {
